{
  "key": 60507,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey. I love strong Pokémon.\r",
        "I feed them Protein to crank up\n",
        "their Attack."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I consider myself a bad guy,\n",
        "but I never liked hanging around\f",
        "other bad ones like Team Rocket."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Iron adds to your\n",
        "Pokémon’s Defense."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Rocket...\n",
        "What are you doing here?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Some Pokémon evolve only\n",
        "through trading.\r",
        "I know of four: MACHOKE, KADABRA,\n",
        "HAUNTER, and, um, GRAVELER.\f",
        "I heard there are others, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Even Team Rocket wouldn’t steal their\n",
        "own members’ Pokémon, would they?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0595_T25R1004_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Let Us Pump Up Your Pokémon!\n",
        "4F Medicine Box"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
